{"c":[{"name":"20261003T195705Z-0509a06fd894e25f","text":"Caret's ask field lives in the activity list panel (OverlayPanel keyable, non-activating); Return/Tab/Esc are intercepted in the panel's sendEvent, because the field editor eats Tab and Esc before SwiftUI onKeyPress (A13).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261003T195705Z-b2dcf80bc4cc0ac3","text":"helper/fixtures/golden/protocol.ndjson line 32 still holds the host's pre-calendar default roles; HelperProtocolTests compares it with calendar removed until the screen track rewrites the line (A13).","type":"note"}]}
